sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as 浏览器
    participant F as 前端 Router/Guard
    participant AX as axios(api.js)
    participant JW as JwtAuthFilter
    participant SC as SecurityConfig
    participant PA as PermissionAspect(新)
    participant PS as PermissionService(改)
    participant RD as Redis
    participant DS as DataScopeAspect(新)
    participant DSS as DataScopeService(改)
    participant C as Controller
    participant S as Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over B,DB: 1) 登录
    B->>AX: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    AX->>C: 白名单放行
    C->>S: AuthService.login()
    S->>DB: 查/建 users + 角色包
    S-->>B: AuthResp(token,userId,phone,locale)

    Note over B,DB: 2) 拉菜单与权限(登录后一次)
    B->>AX: GET /api/v1/admin/permissions/mine
    AX->>AX: 注入 Authorization + Accept-Language
    AX->>JW: Bearer token
    JW->>JW: 解析为 ClawUser 放入 SecurityContext
    JW->>SC: anyRequest().authenticated()
    SC->>C: 放行
    C->>PS: effectivePermissions(userId)
    PS->>RD: 查 perm:{userId} 缓存
    alt 缓存命中
        RD-->>PS: Set of perms
    else 缓存未命中
        PS->>DB: user_roles 并集 user_role_packages
        PS->>DB: 角色继承 parentId 递归 + roles.grants
        PS->>DB: role_permissions 取 permission code/perms
        PS->>RD: 写入 TTL 300s
    end
    PS->>DB: permissions 树(menu_type<2 且未隐藏)
    PS-->>B: menus + buttons + dataScope
    B->>F: 写入 permStore(sessionStorage)
    F->>F: 后端菜单树 合并 本地MenuManager覆盖 再按权限过滤
    F-->>B: 渲染侧边栏(无权限项不出现)

    Note over B,DB: 3) 访问受保护接口(核心拦截)
    B->>AX: POST /api/v1/assets/export
    AX->>JW: Bearer
    JW->>SC: authenticated
    SC->>PA: 命中 @RequirePermission("asset:export")
    PA->>PS: hasPermission(userId,"asset:export")
    PS->>RD: 查缓存(未命中回 DB)
    alt 有权限
        PS-->>PA: true
        PA->>DS: @DataScope(entity="asset") 绑定上下文
        DS->>DSS: resolve(userId)
        DSS->>DB: 部门 org_code + 角色 dataScope + data_rules
        DSS-->>DS: DataScopeResult
        DS->>DS: 写入 DataScopeContext(ThreadLocal)
        DS->>C: 放行
        C->>S: assetService.list(...)
        S->>DB: Specification + DataScopeSpec.apply
        DB-->>S: 已过滤的数据
        S-->>B: 200 数据
        DS->>DS: finally 清理 ThreadLocal
    else 无权限
        PS-->>PA: false
        PA-->>B: 403 无操作权限(已 i18n)
    end

    Note over B,DB: 4) 按钮显隐(纯前端体验)
    B->>F: 渲染页面
    F->>F: usePerm("asset:export") 查 permStore
    F-->>B: 有则渲染 无则隐藏

    Note over B,DB: 5) 权限变更即时失效
    B->>C: PUT /api/v1/admin/permissions/role/{id}
    C->>PS: evictCache(受影响 userId)
    PS->>RD: DEL perm:*
